{
  "$comment": "Per-page SEO meta matrix. Single source of truth for titles, descriptions, indexability, JSON-LD types and sitemap hints. scripts/check-seo-matrix.ts enforces: (1) no duplicate paths, (2) every product in lib/constants CATALOG has a /product/<slug> entry, (3) every nav href in lib/navigation has an entry, (4) every titleKey/descriptionKey exists in messages/en.json. Titles/descriptions are message keys (localised), never literal strings.",
